{"id":"nachforschung","lemma":"Nachforschung","pos":"noun","rank":4797,"glosses":["investigation","inquiry"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/De-Nachforschung.ogg/De-Nachforschung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Nachforschung","plural":"Nachforschungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir müssen gleich Nachforschungen in der Sache machen.","en":"We must look into the matter at once.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"alike"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"matter"},{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Ich habe ein paar Nachforschungen angestellt.","en":"I've been doing some research.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,null,null,{"g":"employed, hired"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"some"]]},{"text":"Sag Tom, dass er Nachforschungen anstellen soll.","en":"Tell Tom to investigate.","words":[{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to queue, to line up"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"}]},{"text":"Der Farmer, der in der Nähe wohnte, kam, um Nachforschungen anzustellen.","en":"The farmer that lived nearby came to investigate.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"farmer"},{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"around / at"},null,{"g":"to queue, to line up","l":"anstellen"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"near"]]}]}